      "text": "LANE-RISK takes nothing until the 24th. Data lane: Tuesday evening is the DNS change, Wednesday night is Bruno's own feature-store rebuild and the evening is the loader release, Friday evening is reconciliation, Saturday evening is the reindex hold.",
      "ts": "2026-04-14T07:40:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Wren Haviland",
      "text": "Dario has every secondary block on Thursday and he does not hold the fraud runbook cert, so Thursday's sessions are out for a fraud change.",
      "ts": "2026-04-14T07:46:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Tunde Abara",
      "text": "The promo peak-trading freeze covers every lane Sunday and Monday. Two pools in one night is Bruno and me together, and nobody has asked.",
      "ts": "2026-04-14T08:02:00"
    }
  ],
  "thread_id": "CHAT-2006",
  "title": "SVCOPS-0006 risk lane suspension \u2014 fraud pools"
}

